.TH ZERODDS-WS-BRIDGED 1 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-ws-bridged \- DDS to WebSocket bridge daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-ws-bridged
[\fB\-c\fR \fIFILE\fR | \fB\-\-config\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-log\-level\fR \fILEVEL\fR]
[\fB\-\-metrics\-bind\fR \fIADDR\fR]
[\fB\-\-validate\-only\fR]
[\fB\-V\fR | \fB\-\-version\fR]
[\fB\-h\fR | \fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-ws-bridged
exposes selected DDS topics to WebSocket clients and forwards inbound WS
messages onto matching DDS publishers. It is the reference DDS \(<-) WS
bridge for the ZeroDDS distribution and implements
.IR zerodds-ws-bridge-1.0 (7).
.PP
The daemon is configured via a YAML file (default
.IR /etc/zerodds/ws-bridged.yaml ).
On Linux it integrates with
.BR systemd (1)
via Type=notify; on macOS with
.BR launchd (8);
on Windows it runs as service
.BR ZeroDDSWSBridge .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config =\fIFILE\fR
Path to the YAML configuration. See
.BR zerodds-ws-bridged.yaml (5).
.TP
.BR \-\-log\-level =\fILEVEL\fR
Override the configured log level. One of
.IR trace ", " debug ", " info ", " warn ", " error .
.TP
.BR \-\-metrics\-bind =\fIADDR\fR
Override the Prometheus metrics endpoint, e.g.
.IR 0.0.0.0:9091 .
.TP
.BR \-\-validate\-only
Parse the config, perform schema + cross-reference checks, exit 0 on
success. Used by CI and packaging postinst scripts.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version and license info.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print full option synopsis.
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGTERM
Graceful shutdown (drain in-flight WS frames, unregister DDS readers).
.TP
.B SIGHUP
Reload the configuration file. New routes are added, removed routes are
disabled, in-flight messages drain.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ZERODDS_CONFIG
Fallback config path if
.B \-\-config
is not provided.
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Filter directives in
.BR tracing-subscriber (3)
syntax. Overrides the YAML log section.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Successful shutdown via SIGTERM.
.TP
.B 64
Configuration error. Run with
.BR \-\-validate\-only
to inspect.
.TP
.B 73
Bind error \(em address in use, permission denied or invalid TLS material.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/zerodds/ws-bridged.yaml
Default configuration. Documented in
.BR zerodds-ws-bridged.yaml (5).
.TP
.I /var/log/zerodds/ws-bridged.log
Log target when
.I logging.destination
is
.IR file:... .
.TP
.I /var/lib/zerodds/
Persistent state (route shadows, durable WS session ids).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-ws-bridged.yaml (5),
.BR zerodds-mqtt-bridged (1),
.BR zerodds-admin (1),
.BR systemd.service (5).
.SH STANDARDS
DDS 1.4, RTPS 2.5, XTypes 1.3, RFC 6455 (WebSocket), RFC 7692 (permessage-deflate).
